# valgrind suppressions for the swBroker functest suite (--vt).
#
# Scope: only genuinely-unavoidable noise from third-party libraries that the
# broker links but does not own (mongo C driver / libbson, OpenSSL, libpq,
# libmicrohttpd, glibc loader). Add an entry ONLY after confirming the stack is
# entirely in library code and not reachable from broker allocations.
#
# Generate candidates with:  valgrind ... --gen-suppressions=all
#
# (Start empty — entries are added from real runs as they prove necessary.)
